      "treatment_summary": "Antihistamines (levocetirizine, cetirizine, fexofenadine, loratadine) did not suppress urticaria; prednisone and steroid injections were the only treatments that cleared the hives; prednisone eventually stopped due to side effects. Authors suggest a future trial of anti-IgE therapy (omalizumab).",
